  "body": "Requested by the maintainer (2026-11-14, in chat): \"\"Pick\" buttons should be clearly visible with its own backgorund color like in the setup browser section we can see what we are selecting\"\n\nWhat happens: a \"Pick\" button in a dialog or page looks like the other buttons. The user does not see easily which pick is active.\n\nWanted:\n- Each \"Pick\" button has its own background colour.\n- An active pick shows clearly what the user selects, as the setup browser section does.\n- All \"Pick\" buttons use one style from one place in the UI code.\n\nDone means: all \"Pick\" buttons use the shared style; the active pick has a different, clearly visible state; a structural UI test pins the active state of one pick button; the PR description has before and after screenshots.\n",
